{{Term/Store|Stealthfin Trout|Stealthfin Trouts|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s and [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Stealthfin Trout}}
Stealthfin Trouts can be found in bodies of [[Water (Terrain)|Water]] in both the [[Great Hyrule Forest]] and [[Eldin Mountains]], though they are plentiful within [[Lake Mekar]]. They are easy to find at night due to the fact that they glow in the dark.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> If [[Link]] eats a Stealthfin Trout, he will regain one [[Heart]] in his [[Life Gauge]]. They can also be burned by [[Fire]] to become [[Roasted Trout]] or chilled by [[Ice]] to become [[Frozen Trout]]. [[Cooking]] with Stealthfin Trout results in a [[Meal]] that will temporarily grant Link [[Stealth Up]] when eaten.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

Stealthfin Trouts, as well as other [[Fish]], can be used in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make to make the following Meals:
